        <activityName xml:lang="en">Waste, asphalt production</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Waste, asphalt production
The data originate from a survey of asphalt plants conducted as part of the Asphalt Calculator project. 
UUID: 493592ca-2426-4d32-a7a7-9e725e58851b
The process includes the disposal of waste generated per ton of asphalt produced.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Treatment of waste from filler, site sludge, and combustible waste is included.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: Unknown
Sampling: Survey
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_493592ca-2426-4d32-a7a7-9e725e58851b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
